---
description: "Architecture and dependency rules for Remesas web JavaScript, HTML, CSS and offline cache"
globs: "js/**/*.js"
alwaysApply: false
---

For changes to JavaScript modules, follow the root `AGENTS.md`. Use `PROJECT_MAP.md` and `docs/DEPENDENCY_MAP.md` to identify direct and cross-module dependencies before editing. Scripts are classic global scripts: preserve load order in `index.html`. If adding/removing/renaming a script, update both `index.html` and `sw.js`, and review the service-worker cache version. For persisted data or transaction changes, check `js/db.js`, balance/debt side effects and `js/respaldos.js` compatibility. Read only relevant modules; don't scan the whole repository by default.
